Johnston、Li、Plosker、Poon、Regula，
*Some notes on the robustness of k-coherence and k-entanglement*，
[arXiv:1806.00653v3](https://arxiv.org/html/1806.00653v3)，§II 式 (2)–(3)、§III Theorem 1，
